 Closing Date: November 2, 2026 at 4pm 
 Available opportunities: 
 Full Time Permanent 
 Camas Gardens
 26-046 - HSW - Camas Gardens - 1:00pm-9:30pm, Sunday and Monday and every other Tuesday, and 3:00pm-11:30pm Friday and Saturday (72 hours bi-weekly)
